              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Qoomaarihe Yoabu a geeraharusmoó úr oo slaqwaruuse sleémeero ar Israeli. Benaya, garmoó Yehoyada, a heé úr oo múk Kereti nee múk Peleti. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.20.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.20.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 20:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Adoramu gadiyeérós a mukdá' taa /uurutís baraá gadiyeé, gun sagesihhmiit. Yehoshafati gadiyeérós a muruudá' inslaslángw wa hariím gun gooín. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.20.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.20.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 20:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Shausha a geeraharusmoó lohdaá gadiyeé gi qoomeemeés. Sadoki nee Abiatari a kaahamuusér Mungú. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.20.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.20.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 20:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ira, heé múk Yairi sleeme a kaahamusmoó Mungú oo Daudi gu alee/iimiís.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.20.26",
